# Node / pnpm / Next / Turbo — repo-wide.
# `.pnpm-store/` is a package-manager cache. It is machine-local and
# regenerable, and pnpm mirrors the workspace into it, so committing it
# duplicates the source tree. Keep the store outside the repo entirely:
#   pnpm config set store-dir ~/.pnpm-store --global
**/node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
*.tsbuildinfo

