# The owner's working notes, client documents and screenshots. Committed by
# accident: 86 files, 30MB, including a contributor name/email dump and a client
# cost estimate. Kept on disk, excluded from future commits. The copies already in
# this branch's history are a separate decision, to be taken before it merges.
srikar-prompts/

# Celery beat's scheduler state. Local runtime data, rewritten on every beat run,
# and sharing it between hosts would let one inherit another's last-run times.
# beat.ps1 warns against exactly that: a second scheduler double-fires every
# periodic task.
backend/celerybeat-schedule
backend/celerybeat-schedule-shm
backend/celerybeat-schedule-wal
